rds Ltd. Tracks 1-13 to 1-15 licensed from Chameleon Records. Track 1-16 courtesy of MCA Records, Inc.\nThis Compilation ℗ & © 1991 Rhino Records, Inc. 2225 Colorado Avenue , Santa Monica, CA 90404-5555\n\n[Back of Disc 2 Jewel Case]\nTracks 2-1, 2-2, and 2-7 licensed from Chameleon Records. Tracks 2-3 to 2-5, 2-8, 2-9, and 2-11 courtesy of MCA Records, Inc. Track 2-6 licensed from Gusto Records. Track 2-10 licensed from AVI Entertainment, Inc. On tracks 2-12 and 2-13 John Lee Hooker appears courtesy of EMI, a Division of Capitol Records, Inc., under licensed from CEMA Special Markets. Track 2-14 ℗ 1987 Blind Pig Records, licensed from Blind Pig Records. Track 2-15 ℗ 1990 R.B.M. Television Corp., licensed from R.B.M. Television Corp. Bonnie Raitt appears courtesy of Capitol Records.\nThis Compilation ℗ & © 1991 Rhino Records, Inc. 2225 Colorado Avenue , Santa Monica, CA 90404-5555\n\n[Discs]\nThis Compilation ℗ 1991 Rhino Records, Inc.",
